url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"There might be multi parents which need skip, so we cannot just use direct parent to  `move_before` or `move_after`.\nWe should find the final visible parent and let it be the moving target of child node.","created_at":"2026-05-19T11:37:10Z","updated_at":"2026-05-19T11:37:10Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118489#discussion_r3265942659","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118489","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3265942659"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118489#discussion_r3265942659"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118489"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3265942659/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":1103,"original_line":1103,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":3265896307,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":22,"position":22,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3266161569","pull_request_review_id":4318756247,"id":3266161569,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7Crauh","diff_hunk":"@@ -1098,10 +1100,8 @@ bool SceneTreeEditor::_update_filter_helper(TreeItem *p_parent, bool p_scroll_to\n \n \t\t\t\t\tp_parent->remove_child(ti);\n \t\t\t\t\tfiltered_parent->add_child(ti);\n-\t\t\t\t\tTreeItem *prev = p_parent->get_prev();\n-\t\t\t\t\tif (prev) {\n-\t\t\t\t\t\tti->move_after(prev);\n-\t\t\t\t\t}\n+\t\t\t\t\tti->move_after(candidate_sibling);","path":"editor/scene/scene_tree_editor.cpp","commit_id":"a1abb3c02eeba86ff6c231649369deb2a4449a2c","original_commit_id":"754ec48c928fa7b1c38b419baa743a685059d852","user":{"login":"prvak","id":2436340,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzYzNDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2436340?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak","html_url":"https://github.com/prvak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Interesting. How could it work before? Consider this hierarchy:\n```\nA        (filtered_parent - the first visible predecessor of C2)\n- B      (p_parent->get_parent() - direct parent of C2, it is not visible)\n  - C1   (p_parent->get_prev())\n  - C2   (p_parent)\n    - D  (ti)\n```\n`D` would be removed from `C2` and added as a child of `A`  and then it would be moved \"after\" `C1`, which is not child of `A`.\n\nDo you know why the node needs to be moved at all? Why `filtered_parent->add_child(ti);` is not enough?","created_at":"2026-05-19T12:16:13Z","updated_at":"2026-05-19T12:16:14Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118489#discussion_r3266161569","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118489","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3266161569"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118489#discussion_r3266161569"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118489"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3266161569/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":1103,"original_line":1103,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":3265896307,"author_association":"NONE","original_position":22,"position":22,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3266338001","pull_request_review_id":4318977663,"id":3266338001,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7CsFzR","diff_hunk":"@@ -1098,10 +1100,8 @@ bool SceneTreeEditor::_update_filter_helper(TreeItem *p_parent, bool p_scroll_to\n \n \t\t\t\t\tp_parent->remove_child(ti);\n \t\t\t\t\tfiltered_parent->add_child(ti);\n-\t\t\t\t\tTreeItem *prev = p_parent->get_prev();\n-\t\t\t\t\tif (prev) {\n-\t\t\t\t\t\tti->move_after(prev);\n-\t\t\t\t\t}\n+\t\t\t\t\tti->move_after(candidate_sibling);","path":"editor/scene/scene_tree_editor.cpp","commit_id":"a1abb3c02eeba86ff6c231649369deb2a4449a2c","original_commit_id":"754ec48c928fa7b1c38b419baa743a685059d852","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"In my opinion, this code cannot work correctly before. I guess it presume there is only one level of parent which need hide.\r\n\r\n```\r\nA        (filtered_parent - the first visible predecessor of C2)\r\n- B      (p_parent->get_parent() - direct parent of C2, it is not visible)\r\n  - C1   (p_parent->get_prev())\r\n  - C2   (p_parent)\r\n    - D  (ti)\r\n- B1\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhen there are more children of A, e.g. B1 above, `filtered_parent->add_child(ti)` will put `D` after `B1`, if `B1` is visible, there result order is wrong. Our aim is keep the original order of tree, so we want to put `D` before `B1`.","created_at":"2026-05-19T12:42:51Z","updated_at":"2026-05-19T12:42:52Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118489#discussion_r3266338001","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118489","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3266338001"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118489#discussion_r3266338001"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118489"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3266338001/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":1103,"original_line":1103,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":3265896307,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":22,"position":22,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3266557253","pull_request_review_id":4319259725,"id":3266557253,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7Cs7VF","diff_hunk":"@@ -1083,11 +1083,13 @@ bool SceneTreeEditor::_update_filter_h